WEBVTT

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:23.080
For three memorable years, red and black were the colors of royalty in the NBA.

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.490
But that dynasty is now history.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:27.870
Soon, a new champion will reign.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:29.850
This symbol of supremacy.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.360
rides on the outcome.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.360
The two teams intent on seizing the prize

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.400
have different styles and personnel,

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.920
but they share something essential.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.240
The New York Knicks and the Houston Rockets

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:43.300
are passion personified.

00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:56.590
Times and bad, Patrick Ewing has been the man in New York.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.770
For nine years, his ability and desire have never diminished.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:05.920
star, dream teamer. But still, one precious credential is missing, and he has learned these

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:12.080
opportunities are rare. Hakeem Olajuwon's play this year has exhausted all superlatives.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:18.200
Still, the league's MVP knows his individual success was a direct result of team unity,

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:23.460
a unity they must depend on to defeat a Ewing-led team, something Hakeem was unable

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:29.670
to do once before. Ten years ago, Ewing and Olajuwon met in the NCAA championship game.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.100
Hakeem outscored Patrick 15-10 that night.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:38.840
But when the final score was tallied, Ewing and Georgetown had fulfilled their dream.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:45.000
A decade later, the circumstances are different, but each is again on the verge of a championship.

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:51.960
The question, whose team will have the skill and not incidentally the heart to ascend to the vacant NBA throne?

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:58.900
It begins tonight with this trophy and all it represents at stake.

